abstract: "108 headline items from 13 trustworthy-AI frameworks (7 public, 6 company), coded against 19 themes and mapped to a seven-step practitioner's loop. First coding by Claude (Anthropic), blind second coding by Gemini (Google), disagreements settled by the author. Labels and codes only; no framework text."
keywords:
  - trustworthy AI
  - AI governance
  - responsible AI
  - generative AI
  - AI agents
  - content analysis
